      "marketplace_id": "A21TJRUUN4KGV",
      "language_tag": "en_IN",
      "value": "Enjoy every sip with the ClassicCeramic Coffee Mug, designed for everyday comfort and style. Crafted from high-quality ceramic, this mug is perfect for hot beverages like coffee, tea, milk, or hot chocolate. Its sleek shape and smooth finish make it ideal for home, office, or gifting. The sturdy handle provides a secure grip, while the durable construction ensures long-lasting use. Whether you're starting your day or relaxing in the evening, this mug adds a touch of elegance to your drink experience."
    }
